| s_axi_control | halted      | 0x10   | 32    | R      | Data signal of halted            |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | halted_ctrl | 0x14   | 32    | R      | Control signal of halted         | 0=halted_ap_vld                                                      |
| s_axi_control | error       | 0x20   | 32    | R      | Data signal of error             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | error_ctrl  | 0x24   | 32    | R      | Control signal of error          | 0=error_ap_vld                                                       |
| s_axi_control | tx_id       | 0x30   | 32    | R      | Data signal of tx_id             |                                                                      |
| s_axi_control | tx_id_ctrl  | 0x34   | 32    | R      | Control signal of tx_id          | 0=tx_id_ap_vld                                                       |
